# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The `runtime-prebuilt` stage copies
# the prebuilt assets produced by the CI `build` job. The default `runtime`
# stage rebuilds from source, so a stale local dist/ copied into the builder is
# harmless (it gets overwritten by `npm run build`).
